<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2007-3488>
  dcterms:description "Heap-based buffer overflow in the viewer ActiveX control in Sony Network Camera SNC-RZ25N before 1.30; SNC-P1 and SNC-P5 before 1.29; SNC-CS10 and SNC-CS11 before 1.06; SNC-DF40N and SNC-DF70N before 1.18; SNC-RZ50N and SNC-CS50N before 2.22; SNC-DF85N, SNC-DF80N, and SNC-DF50N before 1.12; and SNC-RX570N/W, SNC-RX570N/B, SNC-RX550N/W, SNC-RX550N/B, SNC-RX530N/W, and SNC-RX530N/B 3.00 and 2.x before 2.31; allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary code via a long first argument to the PrmSetNetworkParam method." ;
