<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2017-11633>
  dcterms:description "An issue was discovered on Wireless IP Camera 360 devices. Remote attackers can discover RTSP credentials by connecting to TCP port 9527 and reading the InsertConnect field." ;
