  rdfs:label "CVE-2017-14444" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2017-14445>
  dcterms:description "An exploitable buffer overflow vulnerability exists in Insteon Hub running firmware version 1012. The HTTP server implementation incorrectly handles the host parameter during a firmware update request, leading to a buffer overflow on a global section. An attacker can send an HTTP GET request to trigger this vulnerability." ;
