<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2017-14447>
  dcterms:description "An exploitable buffer overflow vulnerability exists in the PubNub message handler for the 'ad' channel of Insteon Hub running firmware version 1012. Specially crafted commands sent through the PubNub service can cause a stack-based buffer overflow overwriting arbitrary data. An attacker should send an authenticated HTTP request to trigger this vulnerability." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:hub ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/insteon/hub> ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/insteon/hub_firmware> ;
