<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2017-16344>
  dcterms:description "An attacker could send an authenticated HTTP request to trigger this vulnerability in Insteon Hub running firmware version 1012. At 0x9d01c2c8 the value for the s_url key is copied using strcpy to the buffer at 0xa0001a0c. This buffer is 16 bytes large, sending anything longer will cause a buffer overflow. The destination can also be shifted by using an sn_speaker parameter between \"0\" and \"3\"." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:hub ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/insteon/hub> ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/insteon/hub_firmware> ;
