<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2017-6520>
  dcterms:description "The Multicast DNS (mDNS) responder used in BOSE Soundtouch 30 inadvertently responds to IPv4 unicast queries with source addresses that are not link-local, which allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (traffic amplification) or obtain potentially sensitive information via port-5353 UDP packets." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:smartspeakers ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/bose/soundtouch_30> ;
