<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2017-8221>
  dcterms:description "Wireless IP Camera (P2P) WIFICAM devices rely on a cleartext UDP tunnel protocol (aka the Cloud feature) for communication between an Android application and a camera device, which allows remote attackers to obtain sensitive information by sniffing the network." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/wificam/wireless_ip_camera_%5C%28p2p%5C%29> ;
