<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-17558>
  dcterms:description "Hardcoded manufacturer credentials and an OS command injection vulnerability in the /cgi-bin/mft/ directory on ABUS TVIP TVIP20050 LM.1.6.18, TVIP10051 LM.1.6.18, TVIP11050 MG.1.6.03.05, TVIP20550 LM.1.6.18, TVIP10050 LM.1.6.18, TVIP11550 MG.1.6.03, TVIP21050 MG.1.6.03, and TVIP51550 MG.1.6.03 cameras allow remote attackers to execute code as root." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/abus/tvip_10000> ;
