<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-20007>
  dcterms:description "Yeelight Smart AI Speaker 3.3.10_0074 devices have improper access control over the UART interface, allowing physical attackers to obtain a root shell. The attacker can then exfiltrate the audio data, read cleartext Wi-Fi credentials in a log file, or access other sensitive device and user information." ;
