<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-3920>
  dcterms:description "An exploitable code execution vulnerability exists in the firmware update functionality of the Yi Home Camera 27US 1.8.7.0D. A specially crafted 7-Zip file can cause a CRC collision, resulting in a firmware update and code execution. An attacker can insert an SDcard to trigger this vulnerability." ;
