<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-3934>
  dcterms:description "An exploitable code execution vulnerability exists in the firmware update functionality of Yi Home Camera 27US 1.8.7.0D. A specially crafted set of UDP packets can cause a logic flaw, resulting in an authentication bypass. An attacker can sniff network traffic and send a set of packets to trigger this vulnerability." ;
