<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-6906>
  dcterms:description "A persistent Cross Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability in the Green Electronics RainMachine Mini-8 (2nd Generation) and Touch HD 12 web application allows an attacker to inject arbitrary JavaScript via the REST API." ;
