  rdfs:label "CVE-2018-6906" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-6907>
  dcterms:description "A Cross Site Request Forgery (CSRF) vulnerability in the Green Electronics RainMachine Mini-8 (2nd Generation) and Touch HD 12 web application allows an attacker to control the RainMachine device via the REST API." ;
