  rdfs:label "CVE-2018-6908" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2018-6909>
  dcterms:description "A missing X-Frame-Options header in the Green Electronics RainMachine Mini-8 (2nd Generation) and Touch HD 12 web application could be used by a remote attacker for clickjacking, as demonstrated by triggering an API page request." ;
