<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2019-10710>
  dcterms:description "Insecure permissions in the Web management portal on all IP cameras based on Hisilicon Hi3510 firmware allow authenticated attackers to receive a network's cleartext WiFi credentials via a specific HTTP request. This affects certain devices labeled as HI3510, HI3518, LOOSAFE, LEVCOECAM, Sywstoda, BESDER, WUSONGLUSAN, GADINAN, Unitoptek, ESCAM, etc." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/hisilicon/hi3510> ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/hisilicon/hi3510_firmware> ;
