<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2019-13336>
  dcterms:description "The dbell Wi-Fi Smart Video Doorbell DB01-S Gen 1 allows remote attackers to launch commands with no authentication verification via TCP port 81, because the loginuse and loginpass parameters to openlock.cgi can have arbitrary values. NOTE: the vendor's position is that this product reached end of life in 2016." ;
