<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2019-13598>
  dcterms:description "LuaUPnP in Vera Edge Home Controller 1.7.4452 allows remote unauthenticated users to execute arbitrary OS commands via the code parameter to /port_3480/data_request because the \"No unsafe lua allowed\" code block is skipped." ;
