<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2019-25353>
  dcterms:description "Foscam Video Management System 1.1.4.9 contains a denial of service vulnerability in the username input field that allows attackers to crash the application. Attackers can overwrite the username with a 520-byte buffer of repeated 'A' characters to trigger an application crash during device login." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:assignment <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/assignment/CVE-2019-25353_cameras> ;
