<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2019-25437>
  dcterms:description "Foscam Video Management System 1.1.6.6 contains a buffer overflow vulnerability in the UID field that allows local attackers to crash the application by supplying an excessively long string. Attackers can input a 5000-character buffer into the UID parameter during device addition to trigger an application crash when the Login Check function is invoked." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
