<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2019-9861>
  dcterms:description "Due to the use of an insecure RFID technology (MIFARE Classic), ABUS proximity chip keys (RFID tokens) of the ABUS Secvest FUAA50000 wireless alarm system can easily be cloned and used to deactivate the alarm system in an unauthorized way." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:alarms ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/abus/secvest_wireless_alarm_system_fuaa50000> ;
