  rdfs:label "CVE-2020-25755" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2020-26097>
  dcterms:description "The firmware of the PLANET Technology Corp NVR-915 and NVR-1615 before 2020-10-28 embeds default credentials for root access via telnet. By exposing telnet on the Internet, remote root access on the device is possible. NOTE: This vulnerability only affects products that are no longer supported by the maintainer" ;
