<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2020-9462>
  dcterms:description "An issue was discovered in all Athom Homey and Homey Pro devices up to the current version 4.2.0. An attacker within RF range can obtain a cleartext copy of the network configuration of the device, including the Wi-Fi PSK, during device setup. Upon success, the attacker is able to further infiltrate the target's Wi-Fi networks." ;
