<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2021-21952>
  dcterms:description "An authentication bypass vulnerability exists in the CMD_DEVICE_GET_RSA_KEY_REQUEST functionality of the home_security binary of Anker Eufy Homebase 2 2.1.6.9h. A specially-crafted set of network packets can lead to increased privileges." ;
