<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2021-31793>
  dcterms:description "An issue exists on NightOwl WDB-20-V2 WDB-20-V2_20190314 devices that allows an unauthenticated user to gain access to snapshots and video streams from the doorbell. The binary app offers a web server on port 80 that allows an unauthenticated user to take a snapshot from the doorbell camera via the /snapshot URI." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:doorbell ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/nightowlsp/wdb-20> ;
