  dcterms:description "Annke N48PBB (Network Video Recorder) products of version 3.4.106 build 200422 and prior are vulnerable to a stack-based buffer overflow, which allows an unauthorized remote attacker to execute arbitrary code with the same privileges as the server user (root)." ;
