<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2021-36797>
  dcterms:description "In Victron Energy Venus OS through 2.72, root access is granted by default to anyone with physical access to the device. NOTE: the vendor disagrees with the reporter's opinion about an alleged \"security best practices\" violation" ;
