  rdfs:label "CVE-2021-40150" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2021-40170>
  dcterms:description "An RF replay attack vulnerability in the SecuritasHome home alarm system, version HPGW-G 0.0.2.23F BG_U-ITR-F1-BD_BL.A30.20181117, allows an attacker to trigger arbitrary system functionality by replaying previously recorded signals. This lets an adversary, among other things, disarm an armed system." ;
