  rdfs:label "CVE-2021-40170" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2021-40171>
  dcterms:description "The absence of notifications regarding an ongoing RF jamming attack in the SecuritasHome home alarm system, version HPGW-G 0.0.2.23F BG_U-ITR-F1-BD_BL.A30.20181117, allows an attacker to block legitimate traffic while not alerting the owner of the system." ;
