  dcterms:description "COMMAX CVD-Axx DVR 5.1.4 contains weak default administrative credentials that allow remote password attacks and disclose RTSP stream. Attackers can exploit this by sending a POST request with the 'passkey' parameter set to '1234', allowing them to access the web control panel." ;
