<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2022-21217>
  dcterms:description "An out-of-bounds write vulnerability exists in the device TestEmail functionality of reolink RLC-410W v3.0.0.136_20121102. A specially-crafted network request can lead to an out-of-bounds write. An attacker can send an HTTP request to trigger this vulnerability." ;
