<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2022-33206>
  dcterms:description "Four OS command injection vulnerabilities exists in the web interface /action/wirelessConnect functionality of Abode Systems, Inc. iota All-In-One Security Kit 6.9X and 6.9Z. A specially-crafted HTTP request can lead to arbitrary command execution. An attacker can make an authenticated HTTP request to trigger these vulnerabilities.This vulnerability focuses on the unsafe use of the `key` and `default_key_id` HTTP parameters to construct an OS Command crafted at offset `0x19b1f4` of the `/root/hpgw` binary included in firmware 6.9Z." ;
