  rdfs:label "CVE-2023-28704" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2023-28809>
  dcterms:description "Some access control products are vulnerable to a session hijacking attack because the product does not update the session ID after a user successfully logs in. To exploit the vulnerability, attackers have to request the session ID at the same time as a valid user logs in, and gain device operation permissions by forging the IP and session ID of an authenticated user." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
