<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2023-51629>
  dcterms:description "D-Link DCS-8300LHV2 ONVIF Hardcoded PIN Authentication Bypass Vulnerability. This vulnerability allows network-adjacent attackers to bypass authentication on affected installations of D-Link DCS-8300LHV2 IP cameras. Authentication is not required to exploit this vulnerability.\n\nThe specific flaw exists within the configuration of the ONVIF API. The issue results from the use of a hardcoded PIN. An attacker can leverage this vulnerability to bypass authentication on the system. Was ZDI-CAN-21492." ;
