  rdfs:label "CVE-2024-3850" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2024-39091>
  dcterms:description "An OS command injection vulnerability in the ccm_debug component of MIPC Camera firmware prior to v5.4.1.240424171021 allows attackers within the same network to execute arbitrary code via a crafted HTML request." ;
