<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2024-4063>
  dcterms:description "A vulnerability was found in EZVIZ CS-C6-21WFR-8 5.2.7 Build 170628. It has been classified as problematic. This affects an unknown part of the component Davinci Application. The manipulation leads to improper certificate validation. It is possible to initiate the attack remotely. The complexity of an attack is rather high. The exploitability is told to be difficult. The identifier VDB-261789 was assigned to this vulnerability. NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:assignment <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/assignment/CVE-2024-4063_cameras> ;
