<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2024-52328>
  dcterms:description "ECOVACS robot lawnmowers and vacuums insecurely store audio files used to indicate that the camera is on. An attacker with access to the /data filesystem can delete or modify warning files such that users may not be aware that the camera is on." ;
