  rdfs:label "CVE-2024-5313" .

<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2024-5463>
  dcterms:description "A vulnerability regarding buffer copy without checking the size of input ('Classic Buffer Overflow') has been found in the login component. This allows remote attackers to write specific files containing non-sensitive information and conduct limited denial-of-service attacks via unspecified vectors. This attack only affects the login service which will automatically restart. The following models with Synology Camera Firmware versions before 1.1.1-0383 may be affected: BC500 and TC500." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:affectsProduct <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/product/synology/bc500> ;
