<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2025-53702>
  dcterms:description "Vilar VS-IPC1002 IP cameras are vulnerable to DoS (Denial-of-Service) attacks. An unauthenticated attacker on the same local network might send a crafted request to /cgi-bin/action endpoint and render the device completely unresponsive. A manual restart of the device is required. \nThe vendor did not respond in any way. Only version 1.1.0.18 was tested, other versions might be vulnerable as well." ;
