<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2025-56799>
  dcterms:description "Reolink desktop application 8.18.12 contains a command injection vulnerability in its scheduled cache-clearing mechanism via a crafted folder name. NOTE: this is disputed by the Supplier because a crafted folder name would arise only if the local user were attacking himself." ;
