<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2025-65857>
  dcterms:description "An issue was discovered in Xiongmai XM530 IP cameras on firmware V5.00.R02.000807D8.10010.346624.S.ONVIF 21.06. The GetStreamUri exposes RTSP URIs containing hardcoded credentials enabling direct unauthorized video stream access." ;
