  dcterms:description "Certain IP Camera models developed by Merit LILIN has a OS Command Injection vulnerability, allowing authenticated remote attackers to inject arbitrary OS commands and execute them on the device." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:assignment <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/assignment/CVE-2026-0855_cameras> ;
