<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2026-12527>
  dcterms:description "A broken authorization boundary in the RTSP media delivery pipeline of Shenzhen Liandian Communication Technology LTD V380 IP Camera firmware AppFHE1_V1.0.6.020230803 enables unauthenticated network actors to bypass the device’s credential-enforced live-view workflow and directly retrieve real-time video stream data." ;
  hkg:affectsCategory hiot:cameras ;
  hkg:assignment <https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/assignment/CVE-2026-12527_cameras> ;
