<https://w3id.org/homeiot/kg/cve/CVE-2026-1457>
  dcterms:description "An authenticated buffer handling flaw in TP-Link VIGI C385 V1 Web API lacking input sanitization, may allow memory corruption leading to remote code execution. Authenticated attackers may trigger buffer overflow and potentially execute arbitrary code with elevated privileges." ;
