  dcterms:description "A malicious actor with access to the adjacent network could obtain unauthorized access to a UniFi Protect Camera by exploiting a discovery protocol vulnerability in the Unifi Protect Application (Version 6.1.79 and earlier).\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAffected Products:\r\n\r\nUniFi Protect Application (Version 6.1.79 and earlier).\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMitigation:\r\n\r\nUpdate your UniFi Protect Application to Version 6.2.72 or later." ;
